    ✔ inserts: a patient only for themselves, queued only; admin realm only to principals; a worker needs its patients scope (16.406831ms)
    ✔ the application role cannot change content, delete, or touch receipts; receipts and reads are append-only (11.048666ms)
    ✔ table rules: dedupe key without the recipient, recipient kind consistent, values on the allowlist, forward-only status (11.804954ms)
  ✔ row-level security and grants (100.761839ms)
