    ✔ repointPatient: R rows move to the survivor, K rows stay, counts add up for notifications, receipts and reads; scope is enforced (40.069969ms)
    ✔ exportPart returns the patient's notifications, receipts and reads - no address and no message text exist to leak (27.820161ms)
    ✔ the participants register with the kernel registries once (0.523713ms)
